flowchart TD
    Start([Library export page]) --> Input{Collection, limits and cursor valid?}
    Input -- No --> Error([Error; no successful page])
    Input -- Yes --> Authority[Use fixed ordinary or sensitive reader credentials]
    Authority --> Catalog[Read visible run and live routes with current caller context]
    Catalog --> Visible{Run and required placements accessible?}
    Visible -- No --> Error
    Visible -- Yes --> Read[Commit control transaction; one bounded statement per route group]
    Read --> Oversized{First record exceeds empty-page budget?}
    Oversized -- Yes --> Error
    Oversized -- No --> Append[Decode fitting prefix and validate actual encoded size]
    Append --> Full{Page limit or lookahead reached?}
    Full -- Yes --> Page([Return page and continuation])
    Full -- No --> More{More route groups?}
    More -- Yes --> Read
    More -- No --> Done([Return final page without continuation])
    Read -. Admission or database failure .-> Error
    Append -. Decoding failure or first record cannot fit .-> Error
